{
  "title": "Phrase Gen",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Plays an 8-step",
        "phrase of 16th",
        "notes in C Phrygian,",
        "in time with Move.",
        "",
        "Press a pad and it",
        "writes a new phrase",
        "in the style of six",
        "built-in MIDI",
        "patterns.",
        "",
        "Put it before a",
        "synth and press",
        "Play on Move."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "With this screen",
        "open, every pad is",
        "a GENERATE button",
        "and the pads play",
        "an animation.",
        "",
        "Pads do not reach",
        "Move while the",
        "screen is open.",
        "",
        "Close the screen",
        "and the pads are",
        "Move's again. Then",
        "Trigger decides",
        "which pad generates."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Animation",
      "lines": [
        "Knob 5 picks it:",
        "",
        "Ripple: rings from",
        "the centre. A press",
        "throws one from",
        "that pad.",
        "",
        "Snake: it hunts",
        "food. A press drops",
        "food there.",
        "",
        "Invade: aliens",
        "march down. A press",
        "fires from there.",
        "",
        "Auto: changes every",
        "15 seconds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "lines": [
        "Knob 1: Mutation",
        " 0 = pattern as is",
        " 100 = bold changes",
        "Knob 2: Trigger",
        " any, note, learn",
        "Knob 3: Trig Note",
        " the GENERATE pad",
        " (screen closed)",
        "Knob 4: Source",
        " random, or 1-6",
        "Knob 5: Animation",
        " auto, ripple,",
        " snake, invade",
        "",
        "Touch a knob to see",
        "it big."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Generate",
      "lines": [
        "A pad press does",
        "not play a note. It",
        "writes a new phrase,",
        "which starts at the",
        "top of the next",
        "8 steps, so the",
        "groove never skips.",
        "",
        "Press again before",
        "then and the newest",
        "phrase wins."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Trigger",
      "lines": [
        "Any: every pad is",
        "GENERATE.",
        "",
        "Note: only the pad",
        "that sends Trig Note",
        "generates. Other",
        "pads play the synth",
        "as usual.",
        "",
        "Learn: press the pad",
        "you want. It becomes",
        "Trig Note and the",
        "mode turns to Note."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Timing",
      "lines": [
        "Follows Move's",
        "transport only.",
        "Stopped means",
        "silent: there is no",
        "internal clock.",
        "",
        "Step 1 lands on the",
        "bar and half bar."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
